==============================================================================
2. Design prior from the pilot (power prior, fixed weight a0)
==============================================================================
a0 base = 0.5, grid 0.25, 0.5, 1. Rationale (similar populations): the
pilot enrolled only symptomatic patients, children included (85 of 412);
the validation enrolled adults only, with 54.8% close contacts and 36.7%
referred for symptoms (Bulilete 2021), where Se was lower in asymptomatic
people. Same test, sample type, operators, reference test and country,
contiguous period. Partial similarity: a0 < 1 (0.5 as the base case).

